{"id":"pratiquement","lemma":"pratiquement","pos":"adv","rank":2275,"glosses":["in practice, for all practical purposes, from a practical standpoint","practically, almost"],"ipa":"/pʁa.tik.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/29/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-pratiquement.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-pratiquement.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Je suis pratiquement prêt.","en":"I'm almost ready.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1095567","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null,{"g":"ready"}]},{"text":"La guerre est pratiquement terminée.","en":"The war is practically over.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"war"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null]},{"text":"Le travail est pratiquement terminé.","en":"The work is practically finished.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"work"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"to end","l":"terminer"}]},{"text":"Nous sommes pratiquement une famille.","en":"We're practically family.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"family"}]},{"text":"Je suis pratiquement un adulte maintenant.","en":"I'm practically an adult now.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"adult"},{"g":"now, currently"}]}]}